# Media: only what the site actually references is tracked. The full library
# (900+ files, ~130 MB) lives locally so the admin gallery has everything to
# choose from; the repo carries the ~170 files that are linked to an ad, used
# by a blog post, or referenced in code. Re-fetch the rest with the scripts in
# the README if you need the whole pool on another machine.

assets/img/lib/*
